    "delay_polls": 12,
    "body": "<h1>Responsive local computing</h1><p>This original fixture tests delayed requests and reading on a small screen. A useful interface responds immediately while data loads in the background.</p><h2>Results</h2><p>Static screens do not need continuous animation. Cached text and simple shapes preserve a clear visual hierarchy.</p>"
